==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bannerman Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Kory|Kories]] spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

